00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.100
Within minutes, it was
a trending topic in the U.S.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.868
So thank you for playing along.

00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:34.167
-[ Cheers and applause ]

